exercises.api:
Header: {"alg": "RS256", "typ": "JWT"}
Payload: {"iss": "{integrationKey}", "sub": "{userId}", "aud": "account-d.docusign.com", "iat": {now}, "exp": {now+3600}, "scope": "signature impersonation"}
POST https://account-d.docusign.com/oauth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
grant_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:jwt-bearer&assertion={signedJwt}

GET https://account-d.docusign.com/oauth/auth?response_type=code&scope=signature%20extended&client_id={integrationKey}&redirect_uri={redirectUri}&state={randomState}
POST https://account-d.docusign.com/oauth/token
Authorization: Basic base64({integrationKey}:{secretKey})
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
grant_type=authorization_code&code={code}

GET https://api-d.docusign.com/v1/accounts/{accountId}/agreements?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {accessToken}
Accept: application/json

GET https://api-d.docusign.com/v1/accounts/{accountId}/agreements?limit=2&provisions.expiration_date[gte]={YYYY-MM-DD}&provisions.expiration_date[lte]={YYYY-MM-DD}
GET .../agreements?parties.name_in_agreement={partyName}&status={status}&sort={field}&direction=desc
GET .../agreements?limit=2&ctoken={continuationTokenFromPreviousResponse}
(Operator syntax for date filters: check the API Explorer example for the exact encoding of gte/lte on your first try.)

POST https://api-d.docusign.com/v1/accounts/{accountId}/agreements/{agreementId}/ai/actions/summarize
Authorization: Bearer {accessToken}
Content-Type: application/json

POST {base_uri}/restapi/v2.1/accounts/{accountId}/envelopes
{"emailSubject":"Embed lab","status":"sent","documents":[{"documentId":"1","name":"doc.pdf","documentBase64":"{base64}"}],"recipients":{"signers":[{"email":"{you}","name":"{name}","recipientId":"1","clientUserId":"1001","tabs":{"signHereTabs":[{"documentId":"1","pageNumber":"1","xPosition":"100","yPosition":"100"}]}}]}}
POST {base_uri}/restapi/v2.1/accounts/{accountId}/envelopes/{envelopeId}/views/recipient
{"returnUrl":"http://127.0.0.1:5173/?view=return","authenticationMethod":"none","email":"{you}","userName":"{name}","clientUserId":"1001"}

POST {base_uri}/restapi/v2.1/accounts/{accountId}/envelopes/{envelopeId}/views/recipient
{"returnUrl":"http://127.0.0.1:5173/?view=return","authenticationMethod":"none","email":"{you}","userName":"{name}","clientUserId":"1001","frameAncestors":["http://127.0.0.1:5173","https://apps-d.docusign.com"],"messageOrigins":["https://apps-d.docusign.com"]}
Browser: const ds = await window.DocuSign.loadDocuSign('{integrationKey}'); const s = ds.signing({url, displayFormat:'focused'}); s.on('ready', ...); s.on('sessionEnd', e => log(e.sessionEndType)); s.mount('#container');

POST {base_uri}/restapi/v2.1/accounts/{accountId}/envelopes  (same body, "status":"created")
POST {base_uri}/restapi/v2.1/accounts/{accountId}/envelopes/{envelopeId}/views/sender
{"returnUrl":"http://127.0.0.1:5173/?view=sender-return"}

POST {webformsBasePath}/accounts/{accountId}/forms/{formId}/instances
Embedded: {"clientUserId":"1001","formValues":{"{fieldName}":"value"},"expirationOffset":24}
Remote: {"sendOption":"now","recipients":[{"roleName":"signer1","name":"{name}","email":"{you}"}]}
(Take {webformsBasePath} from the Web Forms API reference / API Explorer for demo before your first call.)
Maestro: Workflows:triggerWorkflow (POST under {maestroBasePath}/accounts/{accountId}/workflows/{workflowId}/...; copy the exact path from the API reference) with instance_name and trigger_inputs -> response instance_url
